{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02EDB0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我想，为了开矿，这里一定砍掉了大片森林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"大概吧。对我们来说，没地方藏身也够麻烦的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"还不只是森林。如果废水没有妥善处理，也有可能污染地下水。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"AUX_WASTEWATER_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"更别说还有人在这种地方协助开发核武器……为什么大家都不珍惜自己的国家呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"JPN_COOPERATION_AND_COUNTRY_CONCERN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……对我这个抛弃了国家的人来说，还真是刺耳。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"JPN_SELF_REPROACH_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不是。Snake也许抛弃了自己的国家，但我想你心里一定还是珍惜祖国的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"JPN_HOMELAND_DISTINCTION_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我珍惜祖国……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"AUX_GENERIC_REPLY_REPLACED_BY_JPN"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯。这点事，连我都看得出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"JPN_EVEN_I_CAN_TELL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"Paz，你……不，珍惜你那份热爱自己国家的心吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"JPN_HESITATION_AND_SENTIMENT_PRIMARY"}]}